            "row_content": "<p><strong>Shipment confirmation & Order tracking</strong></p><p>You will receive a Shipment Confirmation email once your order has shipped containing your tracking number(s). The tracking number will be active within 24 hours.</p><p>We send out tracking information with every order.  Please follow the link to track your packages.</p>",
