    "165039270103654311": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "f61fecf9-4876-4aef-868b-97584b0bdaaa": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Receiving UPS Deliveries",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p><strong>FOR UPS DELIVERIES</strong><br/>UPS delivery days include Monday - Friday and Saturday (in select areas), excluding UPS holidays. UPS may make up to three delivery attempts at its discretion at your address on regular UPS delivery days. After the final attempt, undeliverable parcels will be returned to the sender.<br/>In the event that the parcel is returned to Rustic Strength, you will be responsible for any associated charges.<br/>To prevent your parcel from being returned or to make alternate delivery arrangements, track your parcel. If you want to collect your parcel at a UPS Customer Centre, your request must be received by 7 p.m.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "1b816a10-4e22-411c-9a6e-e86f7224e077": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Receiving XPO/ Freight Deliveries",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<h3>FOR XPO/FREIGHT DELIVERIES - XPO Freight Tracking</h3><p><strong>Delivery Timing:<br/></strong>We try to time the shipment to arrive on days you are open, but delays can change the delivery date. Transit times can vary depending on holidays, weather conditions, and other factors. It is your responsibility to be at your facility at the time of arrival, even if you are not open.</p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>XPO Delivery Notification:</strong></span></p><ul><li>XPO will anticipate the delivery date and contact you when the pallet is nearing your location. </li></ul><p></p><ul><li>XPO will inform you of the scheduled arrival day.</li></ul><p></p><ul><li>They will ask for your preferred delivery time and deliver within a <strong>3-hour window</strong>. This is a time range, not a guaranteed time, due to other deliveries in the region.</li></ul><p></p><ul><li>You must <strong>take delivery within 2 days</strong> of your shipment landing at the terminal in order to avoid storage fees. </li><li><em>If XPO is stating that they are unable to deliver to you within that window, contact support@rusticstrengthwholesale.com with all of the details</em></li></ul><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Delivery Scheduling Options:</strong></span></p><p>If you cannot accept delivery on the scheduled arrival day, you can reschedule for the next business day.</p><p>Rescheduling beyond the next business day will incur a daily storage fee of $66.25/day for the first three days, followed by $221.00/day thereafter.</p><p><em>Example: The pallet is set to arrive on Tuesday. You can set the delivery appointment window for Tuesday or Wednesday. If you set the appointment for Friday, the daily storage fee of $66.25/day for the first three days, followed by $221.00/day thereafter, will be incurred and we will charge you for this storage fee.</em></p><h3><strong>WHAT TO EXPECT AT THE TIME OF DELIVERY</strong></h3><p><strong>Liftgate Delivery:</strong></p><p>The delivery truck will be equipped with a liftgate and hand truck (2-wheeled dolly).</p><p>The liftgate will lower your pallet from the truck to ground level.</p><p><strong>Offloading and Placement:</strong></p><p>The driver will offload the contents of the pallet.</p><p>The driver will move the offloaded items inside the first door of your store, ONLY.</p><p>They only move the pallet or items across the first threshold. If this threshold is upstairs or in any other way not immediately accessible, the driver will leave the pallet as close as possible to the threshold.</p><p><strong>XPO Limitations:</strong></p><p>XPO adheres to strict delivery guidelines.</p><p>Drivers are unable to provide services beyond the described offloading and placement.</p><p><em>Example: The driver is moving a box. They are not allowed to set the box on a shelf, even if the shelf is right next to your door.</em></p><p><strong>We appreciate XPO's friendly staff and reliable service. However, they operate under strict policies. Requesting services beyond the standard delivery scope may result in additional shipping charges (see driver detention).</strong><br/>If the pallet is not delivered in 3-4 business days, please call your local terminal and speak to a human about the anticipated delivery time. The easiest way to find the number for your local terminal is to Google search “XPO freight terminal (enter your city and state)”</p><p></p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
