        },
        "collapsible_row_HgxYWA": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "At the time of Delivery",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Make sure all items are present and undamaged before signing the paperwork. If there are any issues, have the driver notate them on the delivery ticket. If there is no notation on the paperwork, we are not able to file a claim for reimbursement of damaged or missing items.</p><h5><strong>PLEASE NOTIFY US BY EMAIL IF</strong></h5><p>The XPO driver does not bring items inside through the first door.<br/></p><p>If no hand truck was used to move the items off the truck (this is not for your use but for the XPO driver). Please have your own hand truck available for moving items around inside your store.<br/></p><p>An appointment (XPO only) was not set before the driver showing up.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
